 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/19 16:00| 01 | 287| 008| 0815| 0419| 0270| 1352|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/19 08:12| 09 | 267| 076| 0159| 0041| 0122| 0298|    \n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/07/19 00:48| 01 | 309| 008| 0310| 0034| 0261| 0350|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/18 19:36| 01 | 266| 074| 0339| 0038| 0260| 0405|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/17 19:12| 01 | 266| 010| 0424| 0335| 0170| 1007|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/17 17:48| 01 | 243| 060| 045"
